        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86723, Clear Glass T-Knob Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek 86723 Crystal T-Knob Cabinet Pull has glass construction with a solid brass base. The brass base is available in a wide array of modern finish colors. These molded glass pulls are kiln-fired so they are crystal clear. The Crystal T-Knob is a comfortable 2-1/8 inches wide with a 1-3/4 inch projection. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86723-specifications.gif?v=1704354500\" width=\"511\" height=\"193\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86723 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the T-Knob Glass Kitchen Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Clear Glass with Brass Base</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
